WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.550
The medium-punch primer connects at close range.

2
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.250
OD Hyakuretsukyaku hits before the Super cancel.

3
00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:06.050
Hoyokusen continues after OD Legs.

4
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:06.350
Hoyokusen launches Jamie into the air.

5
00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:06.900
A delayed jumping medium kick catches the falling Jamie.

6
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:07.550
Chun-Li dashes beneath the airborne opponent.

7
00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:08.150
Chun-Li and Jamie recover with their positions reversed.
